    <bpmn:process id="W_W4313" name="W4313. Employee Housing Strategy, Eligibility &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Expansion (VS-37); turnover/retention review; site-staffing gap
Frequency: Annual + on expansion
Volume: Enterprise housing strategy across ~205 sites and 5 entities
Owner: Head of People Services / HR (VS-103) / Facilities (VS-138) / Strategy (VS-33)
Participants: HR (VS-19/VS-103), Store/DC Ops (VS-07/VS-04), Facilities (VS-138), Finance (VS-17.4), Property (VS-97)
Source: workflow W4313 — Employee Housing Strategy, Eligibility &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4313_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4313_Lane1" name="People Services">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4313_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4313_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4313_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4313_Lane2" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4313_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4313_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4313_Start4" name="Expansion (VS-37); turnover/retention review; site-staffing gap">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4313_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4313_Task5" name="People Services/Strategy set the housing strategy — eligibility (transferee…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: People Services/Strategy set the housing strategy — eligibility (transferee, new-province hire, night-shift, key-role), coverage (which sites need housing), and operating model (own/lease/manage vs vendor-managed vs housing allowance)
Responsible (R): People Services / Strategy / HR
Accountable (A): CHRO / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4313_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4313_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4313_Task6" name="HR/Ops map housing need per site (commute feasibility per VS-141, rental-market…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HR/Ops map housing need per site (commute feasibility per VS-141, rental-market thinness, shift pattern) and size the housing portfolio &amp; budget against the expansion plan (10–15 new stores/yr)
Responsible (R): HR / Ops / Finance
Accountable (A): CHRO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4313_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4313_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4313_Task7" name="People Services document the strategy, obtain approval, and cascade to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: People Services document the strategy, obtain approval, and cascade to portfolio (W4314), policy (W4315), cost (W4317), and governance (W4319)
Responsible (R): People Services
Accountable (A): CHRO / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4313_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4313_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4313_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4313_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-662 (ensure controlled execution — Housing Strategy, Portfolio &amp; Policy Framework (PA-144.1).) | - CTL-662: strategy approved (CHRO/COO/CFO); eligibility transparent; need tied to commute/retention data
Owner: Head of People Services / HR (VS-103) / Facilities (VS-138) / Strategy (VS-33)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4313_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4313_Annotation9" targetRef="W4313_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
