    <bpmn:process id="W_W4314" name="W4314. Housing Portfolio Planning, Lease-vs-Own &amp; Site Selection" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4313); new-site opening (VS-37); lease expiry
Frequency: Per lifecycle + annual plan
Volume: Housing portfolio across sites (units/beds)
Owner: Housing Portfolio / Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20) / Facilities (VS-138)
Participants: Property (VS-97), Facilities (VS-138), Finance (VS-40/VS-17.4), Legal (VS-100.3), Procurement (VS-34)
Source: workflow W4314 — Housing Portfolio Planning, Lease-vs-Own &amp; Site Selection</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4314_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4314_Lane1" name="Portfolio">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4314_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4314_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4314_Lane2" name="Property">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4314_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4314_Lane3" name="Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4314_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4314_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4314_Start5" name="Strategy (W4313); new-site opening (VS-37); lease expiry">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4314_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4314_Task6" name="Portfolio/RE plan the housing footprint per site — units/beds needed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Portfolio/RE plan the housing footprint per site — units/beds needed, lease-vs-own-vs-vendor-managed decision, location (proximity/safety/access to site), and build/lease cost
Responsible (R): Portfolio / RE / Finance
Accountable (A): Head of People Services / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4314_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4314_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4314_Task7" name="Property/Legal source &amp; lease/purchase units or contract a vendor-managed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Property/Legal source &amp; lease/purchase units or contract a vendor-managed dormitory, with terms (rent, maintenance, safety compliance, exit) per VS-97/VS-34
Responsible (R): Property / Legal / Procurement
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Legal
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4314_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4314_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4314_Task8" name="Facilities/Asset register housing units as assets/leases (VS-35/VS-42), track…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities/Asset register housing units as assets/leases (VS-35/VS-42), track capacity vs need, and feed capex/opex to VS-40/VS-17.4
Responsible (R): Facilities / Asset / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4314_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4314_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4314_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4314_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-662 (ensure controlled execution — Housing Strategy, Portfolio &amp; Policy Framework (PA-144.1).) | - CTL-662: site selection on proximity/safety; lease-vs-own lifecycle-costed; assets/leases registered (VS-35/VS-42)
Owner: Housing Portfolio / Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20) / Facilities (VS-138)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4314_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4314_Annotation10" targetRef="W4314_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
