      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4317_Task5" name="Finance/HR set the housing cost model — full cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance/HR set the housing cost model — full cost (rent/utilities/maintenance/housekeeping), subsidy % by eligibility tier, employee share, and salary-deduction treatment (incl. BIR/tax per VS-79 for de-minimis/benefit-in-kind)
Responsible (R): Finance / HR / Tax
Accountable (A): CFO / CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4317_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4317_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4317_Task6" name="Payroll/Shared Services process the monthly salary deduction and the entity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Payroll/Shared Services process the monthly salary deduction and the entity cost allocation (which entity bears the housing cost — Depot vs Logistics vs Property, per intercompany VS-72)
Responsible (R): Payroll / Shared Services
Accountable (A): Finance Mgr
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4317_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4317_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4317_Task7" name="Finance reconcile housing cost/recovery, allocate intercompany (VS-72), and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance reconcile housing cost/recovery, allocate intercompany (VS-72), and report net housing cost vs budget
Responsible (R): Finance / Shared Services
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4317_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4317_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4317_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
