    <bpmn:process id="W_W4320" name="W4320. Housing System &amp; Resident Data Architecture (HR↔Facilities↔Finance)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4313); system lifecycle; data need
Frequency: Per lifecycle + continuous operation
Volume: One housing system/data architecture
Owner: Housing Ops / IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113) / HR-Tech (VS-103.3)
Participants: IT (VS-27), EA (VS-113), HR-Tech (VS-103.3), Finance (VS-17.4), Facilities (VS-138), Privacy (VS-91)
Source: workflow W4320 — Housing System &amp; Resident Data Architecture (HR↔Facilities↔Finance)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4320_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4320_Lane1" name="Housing Ops">
