      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4320_Task5" name="Housing Ops/EA/IT design the housing data architecture — unit/bed master…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Housing Ops/EA/IT design the housing data architecture — unit/bed master, resident assignment, occupancy, cost/recovery, maintenance, safety-inspection, and integration to HRIS (VS-103), payroll (VS-19.2), GL (VS-17), facilities (VS-138)
Responsible (R): Housing Ops / EA / IT / HR-Tech
Accountable (A): CIO / Head of People Services
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4320_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4320_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4320_Task6" name="IT/HR-Tech implement &amp; integrate, govern resident data privacy (VS-91 — PII…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/HR-Tech implement &amp; integrate, govern resident data privacy (VS-91 — PII minimization, consent, retention), and govern data quality
Responsible (R): IT / HR-Tech / Privacy
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per deployment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4320_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4320_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4320_Task7" name="Housing Ops/IT govern the platform lifecycle (roadmap, adoption, TBM cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Housing Ops/IT govern the platform lifecycle (roadmap, adoption, TBM cost VS-135, security VS-27.3), and optimize on analytics (W4336)
Responsible (R): Housing Ops / IT
Accountable (A): CIO / CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4320_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4320_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4320_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
