        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-662 (ensure controlled execution — Housing Strategy, Portfolio &amp; Policy Framework (PA-144.1).) | - CTL-662: architecture security-assessed (VS-27.3); PII minimized &amp; consented (VS-91); cost governed (VS-135)
Owner: Housing Ops / IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113) / HR-Tech (VS-103.3)</bpmn:text>
